# The Angle Report workflow

This repository uses a phased, checkpointed development workflow.

- Before substantial implementation, read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/development/CURRENT_PHASE.md`.
- Read `docs/development/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/development/DECISIONS.md` when architecture is relevant.
- Read `docs/development/HANDOFF.md` before continuing previous work.
- Protect the current Git checkpoint. Do not silently advance development phases.
- Never expose or commit secrets (`.env.local`, `DATABASE_URL` values, API keys).
- Preserve evidence and provenance safeguards.
- Prefer minimal additive changes. Do not broad-refactor unless authorized.
- Validate builds/diffs before recommending a checkpoint.
- After substantial work, update `docs/development/HANDOFF.md` for the next engineering agent: facts, files, tests, unresolved issues, and Git state.
